[center][size=6][b]ARPG MOVEMENT[/b][/size]
[size=4]Click. Hold. Explore.[/size]

[b]Turn Fields of Mistria into a more direct, mouse-driven adventure.[/b]
Move with intention, interact from a distance, and let the right tool snap into your hand when you need it.
[/center]

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/phob/mistria-fluid/main/nexus/assets/floral-bouquet-separator.png[/img][/center]

[size=4][b][color=#f6b24a]⚠ MOMI REQUIRED[/color][/b][/size]
[b]Requires MOMI 0.14.0 beta 3 or newer.[/b]
The MOMI build currently on Nexus (0.13.x) cannot install this mod. Download [url=https://github.com/Garethp/Mods-of-Mistria-Installer/releases/tag/v0.14.0-beta-3]MOMI 0.14.0 beta 3 from the official GitHub releases page[/url], then install this mod normally.

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/phob/mistria-fluid/main/nexus/assets/floral-vine-separator.png[/img][/center]

[size=5][b]YOUR NEW MOVEMENT KIT[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]AUTO TOOL SWAPPING[/b] — Click a rock, tree, stump, or dig spot and the right tool is equipped before your character acts.[/*]
[*][b]SMART INTERACTIONS[/b] — Click a distant NPC, chest, door, or usable object to walk into range and interact.[/*]
[*][b]MOUSE-DRIVEN MOVEMENT[/b] — Hold right mouse to steer; tap right mouse to path to a destination.[/*]
[*][b]MOUNTED & SWIMMING CONTROLS[/b] — Keep steering while riding or swimming.[/*]
[*][b]CLEAR CLICK FEEDBACK[/b] — A normal poof confirms a valid destination; a red poof means it cannot be reached.[/*]
[/list]

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/phob/mistria-fluid/main/nexus/assets/floral-vine-separator.png[/img][/center]

[size=5][b]CONTROLS[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Hold right mouse[/b] — Steer toward the cursor. Move close to walk; move farther away to run. Hold your normal Walk control whenever you want to stay at walking pace.[/*]
[*][b]Tap right mouse on the ground[/b] — Walk to that spot automatically, navigating around obstacles.[/*]
[*][b]Tap right mouse on a character or object[/b] — Walk into range and interact. Nearby taps still behave like the normal Interact button.[/*]
[*][b]WASD / jump / tool / E / Esc[/b] — Instantly cancel mouse-driven movement. Keyboard control always wins.[/*]
[/list]

While right mouse is held, Interact is temporarily suppressed so you can steer past people, chests, and doors without activating them.

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/phob/mistria-fluid/main/nexus/assets/floral-vine-separator.png[/img][/center]

[size=5][b]AUTO TOOL SWAPPING[/b][/size]

Enabled by default and built around your usual left-click tool action:

[list]
[*]Click a [b]rock[/b] to equip a pickaxe.[/*]
[*]Click a [b]tree or stump[/b] to equip an axe.[/*]
[*]Click a [b]dig spot[/b] to equip a shovel.[/*]
[*]In the [b]mines[/b], other action clicks equip a weapon when one is available.[/*]
[/list]

The mod searches your whole inventory and changes toolbar pages when needed. It will not equip a tool that is too weak, missing, or out of reach.

Press [b]F6[/b] to toggle Auto Tool Swapping. Your choice is remembered.

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/phob/mistria-fluid/main/nexus/assets/floral-vine-separator.png[/img][/center]

[size=5][b]INSTALLATION[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Install [b]MOMI 0.14.0 beta 3 or newer[/b].[/*]
[*]Extract this mod so the file path is [b]mods/arpg_movement/manifest.json[/b].[/*]
[*]Run MOMI and install your mods.[/*]
[/list]

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/phob/mistria-fluid/main/nexus/assets/floral-vine-separator.png[/img][/center]

[size=5][b]CONFIGURATION[/b][/size]

After first launch, settings are created in [b]%LOCALAPPDATA%\FieldsOfMistria\mod_data\arpg_movement\arpg_movement.json[/b].

[list]
[*][b]enabled[/b] — Enable or disable the mod without uninstalling it.[/*]
[*][b]tap_seconds[/b] and [b]steer_start_seconds[/b] — Adjust tap and steering timing.[/*]
[*][b]walk_within_px[/b] and [b]run_beyond_px[/b] — Tune the walk/run distances.[/*]
[*][b]click_to_interact[/b] — Toggle automatic approach and interaction.[/*]
[*][b]click_marker[/b] and [b]invalid_click_marker[/b] — Toggle destination feedback.[/*]
[*][b]auto_select_action_item[/b] — Toggle Auto Tool Swapping.[/*]
[/list]

[size=5][b]COMPATIBILITY[/b][/size]
Gamepad play, cutscenes, scripted movement, and rebound controls are respected. If Interact is moved away from right mouse, right mouse becomes a dedicated movement button.